          "Description": "<i>*Muffled* \"Pardon me? A little help would be lovely…\"</i>\n\nA tiny fairy with a minuscule voice, locked in a crude cage. She’s eager to return home and promises them a gift as thank you when they get there. She’ll offer a healing kiss on the forehead of the most injured hero, restoring all HP and removing all Wounds.\n\n<b>What She Knows.</b> The goblins were hired by someone bad. It sounded like they were arguing about which boss to deliver her to. Apparently, there are two bosses.\n\n<b>Back in Merivale.</b> Moonblossom gifts the party a golden acorn from the Fairy Tree as a token of thanks. (1 time use: reroll any 1 die). The villagers award the heroes with their 20gp/hero.",
